---
const modules = [
	{ x: 16, label: 'source', kind: 'external' },
	{ x: 148, label: 'crawler', kind: 'box' },
	{ x: 280, label: 'inbox', kind: 'store' },
	{ x: 412, label: 'ingester', kind: 'box' },
	{ x: 544, label: 'data lake', kind: 'store' },
	{ x: 676, label: 'mounter', kind: 'box' },
	{ x: 808, label: 'data mart', kind: 'store' },
];
const width = 96;
const flows = ['response', 'envelopes', 'envelopes', 'records', 'partitions', 'results'];
---

<figure class="spool-diagram">
	<svg
		viewBox="0 0 920 206"
		role="img"
		aria-label="A record goes from the source to the crawler, the inbox, the ingester, the data lake, the mounter and the data mart. The crawler tells the ingester with an EnvelopeStored event, the ingester tells the janitor with EnvelopePersisted, and the janitor updates the state in the inbox."
	>
		<defs>
			<marker id="rp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path class="arrowhead" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" />
			</marker>
			<marker id="rp-arrow-event" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path class="arrowhead-event" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" />
			</marker>
		</defs>

		{modules.map((module) => (
			<g>
				<rect class={module.kind} x={module.x} y="40" width={width} height="44" rx="6" />
				<text class="name" x={module.x + width / 2} y="67" text-anchor="middle">{module.label}</text>
			</g>
		))}

		{flows.map((flow, index) => {
			const start = modules[index].x + width + 2;
			const end = modules[index + 1].x - 3;
			const middle = (modules[index].x + width + modules[index + 1].x) / 2;
			return (
				<g>
					<line class="edge" x1={start} y1="62" x2={end} y2="62" marker-end="url(#rp-arrow)" />
					<text class="small" x={middle} y="104" text-anchor="middle">{flow}</text>
				</g>
			);
		})}

		<path class="event" d="M196,38 C196,4 460,4 460,35" marker-end="url(#rp-arrow-event)" />
		<text class="event-label" x="328" y="30" text-anchor="middle">EnvelopeStored</text>

		<rect class="box" x="280" y="150" width={width} height="44" rx="6" />
		<text class="name" x="328" y="177" text-anchor="middle">janitor</text>
		<line class="edge" x1="328" y1="148" x2="328" y2="89" marker-end="url(#rp-arrow)" />
		<text class="small" x="320" y="128" text-anchor="end">updates states</text>

		<path class="event" d="M480,86 C480,140 430,172 381,172" marker-end="url(#rp-arrow-event)" />
		<text class="event-label" x="490" y="150">EnvelopePersisted</text>

		<line class="event" x1="640" y1="186" x2="676" y2="186" />
		<text class="small" x="684" y="190">event on the bus</text>
		<line class="edge" x1="800" y1="186" x2="836" y2="186" />
		<text class="small" x="844" y="190">data</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		The crawler stores each record in the inbox and announces it on the event bus. The ingester reacts, writes the record to the data lake and announces it again, and the janitor keeps the inbox up to date. The mounter turns data lake partitions into a data mart.
	</figcaption>
</figure>
